    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;Angles of Death&quot;</strong> is a top-down 2D pixel art action RPG that thrusts players into a dark and challenging world filled with unique bosses and relentless enemies. Players must battle a variety of foes and overcoming intricate boss mechanics to survive. The game features a rich upgrade system, allowing players to enhance their abilities and unlock new attacks. With a focus on strategic combat and dynamic gameplay, &quot;Angles of Death&quot; offers an immersive experience where every decision can mean the difference between life and death. The game stands out with its intense action sequences making it a must-play for fans of the genre.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>&quot;Angles of Death&quot;</strong> is a top-down 2D pixel art action RPG that thrusts players into a dark and challenging world filled with unique bosses and relentless enemies. Players must battle a variety of foes and overcoming intricate boss mechanics to survive. The game features a rich upgrade system, allowing players to enhance their abilities and unlock new attacks. With a focus on strategic combat and dynamic gameplay, &quot;Angles of Death&quot; offers an immersive experience where every decision can mean the difference between life and death. The game stands out with its intense action sequences making it a must-play for fans of the genre.",
    "short_description": "&quot;Angles of Death&quot; is an action RPG and roguelike game. It blends the intensity of real-time combat and the unpredictability of roguelike mechanics. The pixel art aesthetic adds a nostalgic yet modern visual appeal, while the atmospheric soundtrack immerses players in a dark and captivating world.",
